WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.416 --> 00:00:14.018
&gt;&gt; Laura: THE DEMOCRATIC

00:00:13.417 --> 00:00:15.219
STRONGHOLD OF SAN FRANCISCO HAS

00:00:14.151 --> 00:00:17.855
BECOME, WELL, ESPECIALLY IN

00:00:15.353 --> 00:00:20.891
DOWNTOWN, A FESTERING PILE OF

00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:26.464
GARBAGE FECES AND DRUG NEEDLES.

00:00:21.025 --> 00:00:29.066
ACCORDING TO A SURVEY THE

00:00:26.597 --> 00:00:29.767
INVESTIGATION OF 153 CITY BLOCKS

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:32.203
INCLUDING POPULAR TOUR SPOTS

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:37.108
FOUND TRASHED ON EVERY BLOCK 300

00:00:32.336 --> 00:00:37.475
PILES OF FECES ON 96 BLOCKS,

00:00:37.241 --> 00:00:40.077
LOVELY.

00:00:37.608 --> 00:00:40.878
100 DISCARDED HYPODERMIC NEEDLES

00:00:40.211 --> 00:00:41.712
ON 41 BLOCKS.

00:00:41.012 --> 00:00:43.381
THAT'S ALL.

00:00:41.846 --> 00:00:45.249
THIS IS A SANCTUARY CITY, IS IT?

00:00:43.514 --> 00:00:48.252
IS A LOCAL DELI OWNER.

00:00:45.383 --> 00:00:48.720
HE SPAT UP.

00:00:48.386 --> 00:00:52.090
&gt;&gt; IT'S FILTHY.

00:00:48.853 --> 00:00:53.324
IT'S DISGUSTING.

00:00:52.223 --> 00:00:57.862
YESTERDAY WE TAPED SOMEBODY JUST

00:00:53.458 --> 00:01:00.198
ON THE SIDE OF MY BUILDING

00:00:57.996 --> 00:01:00.565
PEEING ON MY RESTAURANT IN BROAD

00:01:00.331 --> 00:01:02.267
DAYLIGHT.

00:01:00.698 --> 00:01:03.534
I ACTUALLY HAVE PICTURES OF

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:03.868
PEOPLE SHOOTING UP IN THE

00:01:03.668 --> 00:01:05.336
STREET.

00:01:05.470 --> 00:01:06.838
POINT.

00:01:05.770 --> 00:01:07.538
IT'S COMPLETELY OUT OF CONTROL.

00:01:06.971 --> 00:01:10.441
&gt;&gt; Laura: I HAD A CALL OR MY

00:01:07.672 --> 00:01:11.276
RADIO SHOWS TODAY SO SHE WENT TO

00:01:10.575 --> 00:01:12.911
SAN FRANCISCO RECENTLY WITH HER

00:01:11.409 --> 00:01:15.914
KIDS AND SHE ALSO SAW SOMEONE

00:01:13.044 --> 00:01:17.282
SHOOTING UP ON THE SIDE OF THE

00:01:16.047 --> 00:01:18.917
STREET, TYING UP THE ARM,

00:01:17.415 --> 00:01:20.285
PUTTING THE NEEDLE, SHE HAD TO

00:01:19.050 --> 00:01:21.486
SHIELD HER DAUGHTER'S EYES.

00:01:20.418 --> 00:01:22.921
NOT EXACTLY A PARADISE FOR

00:01:21.619 --> 00:01:24.689
BUSINESSES OR WORKERS.

00:01:23.054 --> 00:01:25.456
JOINING US NOW, SAN FRANCISCO

00:01:24.822 --> 00:01:30.261
REPUBLICAN PARTY VICE CHAIR KEN

00:01:25.590 --> 00:01:31.062
LU IS ALSO A POLICE -- AND

00:01:30.395 --> 00:01:33.898
ETHAN, A POLITICAL COMMENTATOR

00:01:31.196 --> 00:01:34.566
IN THE BAY AREA RADIO HOST.

00:01:34.032 --> 00:01:36.868
ETHAN, I LOVE SAN FRANCISCO.

00:01:34.699 --> 00:01:37.402
I LOVE IT.

00:01:37.535 --> 00:01:41.806
I HAVE FRIENDS THERE.

00:01:39.337 --> 00:01:45.010
I'VE BEEN GOING FOR A LONG TIME.

00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:46.044
IT HAS A MAJOR PROBLEM AND I

00:01:45.143 --> 00:01:48.279
DON'T CARE IF YOU'RE A DEMOCRAT,

00:01:46.177 --> 00:01:49.381
REPUBLICAN, OR SOMEWHERE IN

00:01:48.413 --> 00:01:50.782
BETWEEN, IT'S NOT GETTING

00:01:49.514 --> 00:01:51.082
BETTER, IT SEEMS TO BE GETTING

00:01:50.915 --> 00:01:55.286
WORSE.

00:01:51.216 --> 00:01:56.054
WHAT DO YOU THINK?

00:01:55.420 --> 00:01:56.588
&gt;&gt; IT'S TRUE.

00:01:56.187 --> 00:01:59.524
IT IS PROBLEMATIC.

00:01:56.721 --> 00:02:01.460
I WILL SAY THAT UNDER MAYOR ED

00:01:59.658 --> 00:02:02.861
LEE, WHO RECENTLY PASSED AWAY,

00:02:01.593 --> 00:02:05.697
WE PRODUCED A NUMBER OF VETERANS

00:02:02.994 --> 00:02:06.131
WHO ARE HOMELESS IN THE CITY OF

00:02:05.831 --> 00:02:07.265
SAN FRANCISCO.

00:02:06.264 --> 00:02:08.300
WE ARE TAKING AN APPROACH.

00:02:07.399 --> 00:02:10.669
BUT REMEMBER, WE ARE BEING

00:02:08.433 --> 00:02:11.503
HANDCUFFED BY A NUMBER OF LAWS

00:02:10.802 --> 00:02:13.004
THAT PROHIBIT THE ABILITY OF

00:02:11.636 --> 00:02:16.007
TAKING CARE OF PEOPLE WITH

00:02:13.138 --> 00:02:17.476
MENTAL HEALTH ISSUES AND MAKING

00:02:16.141 --> 00:02:18.276
THEM GET THE PSYCHIATRIC CARE

00:02:17.609 --> 00:02:20.078
THAT THEY NEED.

00:02:18.410 --> 00:02:21.279
GETTING THEM THE ADDICTIVE CARE.

00:02:20.212 --> 00:02:24.082
WE ALLOW PEOPLE UNDER THE GUISE

00:02:21.413 --> 00:02:24.883
OF CIVIL LIBERTIES TO BE FREE

00:02:24.216 --> 00:02:26.885
AND NOT PUT THEM IN PLACES TO

00:02:25.016 --> 00:02:28.286
GET THE HELP THAT THEY NEED TO

00:02:27.018 --> 00:02:30.455
PROTECT AND HELP THEMSELVES, LET

00:02:28.420 --> 00:02:31.189
ALONE OTHERS AND ALLOW THEM TO

00:02:30.589 --> 00:02:31.857
BECOME CONTRIBUTING MEMBERS OF

00:02:31.323 --> 00:02:34.226
SOCIETY AGAIN.

00:02:31.990 --> 00:02:38.096
THIS IS A REALLY BIG ISSUE.

00:02:34.359 --> 00:02:39.665
IT NOBODY TO STEP IN FECES.

00:02:38.230 --> 00:02:40.499
I HAVE CHILDREN, I DON'T LIKE

00:02:39.798 --> 00:02:41.667
FINDING USED NEEDLES.

00:02:40.632 --> 00:02:42.835
BUT THERE ARE APPROACHES THAT

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:43.569
THE CITY IS TRYING BUT WE

00:02:42.968 --> 00:02:46.505
ACTUALLY NEED SOME FEDERAL HELP

00:02:43.702 --> 00:02:47.206
IN THIS CASE, IN MY OPINION,

00:02:46.638 --> 00:02:48.841
BECAUSE A LOT OF THE HOMELESS

00:02:47.339 --> 00:02:49.875
ARE NOT FROM SAN FRANCISCO.

00:02:48.974 --> 00:02:50.809
THEY COME BECAUSE THEY ARE NOT

00:02:50.008 --> 00:02:53.278
GOING TO FREEZE TO DEATH WHEN WE

00:02:50.943 --> 00:02:54.480
ARE HAVING A COLD SNAP, UNLIKE

00:02:53.412 --> 00:02:55.214
THE REST OF THE COUNTRY.

00:02:54.613 --> 00:02:56.114
&gt;&gt; Laura: ARE YOU BLAMING FROM

00:02:55.347 --> 00:03:00.018
FOR THIS?

00:02:56.248 --> 00:03:00.419
YOU BLAMING DONALD TRUMP FOR THE

00:03:00.152 --> 00:03:03.856
FACT THAT --

00:03:00.552 --> 00:03:05.457
&gt;&gt; ABSOLUTELY NOT.

00:03:03.989 --> 00:03:06.358
THIS IS A SUCCESSIVE SERIES OF

00:03:05.591 --> 00:03:07.493
ISSUES AND COURT RULINGS FOR

00:03:06.492 --> 00:03:08.894
THAT MATTER.

00:03:07.626 --> 00:03:10.095
YOU KNOW ABOUT THAT.

00:03:09.028 --> 00:03:11.997
WE HAD FOUR FEDERAL COURTS RULED

00:03:10.229 --> 00:03:12.931
THAT WE CAN'T DO CERTAIN THINGS.

00:03:12.131 --> 00:03:14.633
&gt;&gt; Laura: DON'T GET ME STARTED

00:03:13.065 --> 00:03:15.467
ON THE JUDGES.

00:03:14.767 --> 00:03:20.539
I'M GOING TO DO A WHOLE BIG

00:03:15.601 --> 00:03:21.307
SEGMENT ON THE JUDGES TOMORROW.

00:03:20.673 --> 00:03:23.475
ED  LET'S GO TO YOU ON THIS.

00:03:21.440 --> 00:03:23.008
THIS IS SO SAD ON SO MANY LEVELS

00:03:23.008 --> 00:03:23.809
THIS IS SO SAD ON SO MANY LEVEL

00:03:23.609 --> 00:03:26.278
LEVELS.

00:03:23.943 --> 00:03:26.912
THIS IS SUPPOSED TO BE THE

00:03:26.412 --> 00:03:27.346
PROGRESSIVE PARADISE OF

00:03:27.046 --> 00:03:29.848
SAN FRANCISCO.

00:03:27.479 --> 00:03:30.516
IT'S A SUPER DEMOCRAT MAJORITY,

00:03:29.982 --> 00:03:31.951
THE BOARD OF SUPERVISORS FOR

00:03:30.649 --> 00:03:33.752
YEARS -- GOING BACK TO GAVIN

00:03:32.084 --> 00:03:35.688
NEWSOM WHEN HE TRIED TO GET RID

00:03:33.886 --> 00:03:36.689
OF THE CASH -- REMEMBER THE CASH

00:03:35.821 --> 00:03:38.724
FOR THE HOMELESS?

00:03:36.822 --> 00:03:39.959
THEY FOUGHT HIM BACK THEN.

00:03:38.858 --> 00:03:41.160
HE WAS MY FIRST GUEST BY THE WAY

00:03:40.092 --> 00:03:43.896
ON MY RADIO SHOW THAT I EVER HAD

00:03:41.293 --> 00:03:44.263
17 YEARS AGO, IT WAS GAVIN

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:46.065
NEWSOM.

00:03:44.397 --> 00:03:46.966
BUT TO ME IT'S GOTTEN WORSE AND

00:03:46.198 --> 00:03:52.605
WORSE EVEN WITH SOME MODEST

00:03:47.099 --> 00:03:54.741
IMPROVEMENTS AROUND THE EDGES.

00:03:52.738 --> 00:03:56.175
&gt;&gt; GO AHEAD.

00:03:54.874 --> 00:03:58.845
&gt;&gt; Laura: I THINK WE ARE

00:03:56.309 --> 00:03:59.212
HAVING -- ARE WE HAVING AUDIO

00:03:58.978 --> 00:04:04.517
PROBLEMS?

00:03:59.345 --> 00:04:05.084
&gt;&gt; I'M HAPPY TO ANSWER THAT.

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:07.387
&gt;&gt; Laura: ABSOLUTELY.

00:04:05.218 --> 00:04:11.457
IT'S DIRECTED TO YOU.

00:04:07.520 --> 00:04:12.158
&gt;&gt; SAN FRANCISCO HASN'T HAD A

00:04:11.591 --> 00:04:13.926
REPUBLICAN ELECTED OFFICE FOR

00:04:12.291 --> 00:04:15.294
MULTIPLE DECADES NOW.

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:16.229
SO NONE OF THE PROBLEMS THAT WE

00:04:15.428 --> 00:04:19.665
HAVE SEEN IN TERMS OF THE

00:04:16.362 --> 00:04:21.300
HOMELESS YEAR CAN BE ATTRIBUTED

00:04:19.799 --> 00:04:22.068
TO THE REPUBLICANS AT ALL IN

00:04:21.434 --> 00:04:24.637
SAN FRANCISCO, SIMPLY BECAUSE WE

00:04:22.201 --> 00:04:26.673
DON'T HAVE A SINGLE REPUBLICAN

00:04:24.771 --> 00:04:27.507
ELECTED TO OFFICE REPRESENTING

00:04:26.806 --> 00:04:28.474
SAN FRANCISCO.

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:29.876
THE HOMELESS EPIDEMIC THAT WE

00:04:28.608 --> 00:04:30.176
HAVE RIGHT HERE IS JUST GETTING

00:04:30.009 --> 00:04:32.779
WORSE.

00:04:30.310 --> 00:04:33.746
IN FACT, EVERY YEAR -- I WAS

00:04:32.912 --> 00:04:35.715
BORN HERE IN SAN FRANCISCO AND I

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:36.416
CAN SEE PROGRESSIVELY EVERY YEAR

00:04:35.848 --> 00:04:38.518
THE PROBLEM HAS BEEN GETTING

00:04:36.549 --> 00:04:39.886
WORSE AND WORSE EVERY YEAR WITH

00:04:38.651 --> 00:04:41.421
NO SOLUTIONS.

00:04:40.019 --> 00:04:43.489
I'VE MET WITH MULTIPLE BOARD OF

00:04:41.554 --> 00:04:44.257
SUPERVISOR MEMBERS HERE IN

00:04:43.623 --> 00:04:45.158
SAN FRANCISCO AND THEY JUST KEEP

00:04:44.390 --> 00:04:48.161
ASKING FOR MORE MONEY.

00:04:45.291 --> 00:04:49.696
WHEN THEY ASK FOR MORE MONEY IT

00:04:48.294 --> 00:04:50.496
IS BASICALLY REWARDING A PROGRAM

00:04:49.829 --> 00:04:50.897
THAT DOESN'T HAVE ANY

00:04:50.630 --> 00:04:53.600
BENCHMARKS.

00:04:51.030 --> 00:04:54.401
THERE IS NO SOLUTION IN THEIR

00:04:53.733 --> 00:04:57.203
SOLUTION IS TO JUST THROW MORE

00:04:54.534 --> 00:04:59.105
MONEY AT THE PROBLEM.

00:04:57.337 --> 00:05:03.376
&gt;&gt; Laura: WHAT THEY'RE ALSO

00:04:59.239 --> 00:05:04.010
DOING IS DECLARING THEMSELVES

00:05:03.510 --> 00:05:05.912
YEAR AFTER YEAR, WE ARE A

00:05:04.144 --> 00:05:06.980
SANCTUARY CITY, SANCTUARY STATE.

00:05:06.046 --> 00:05:07.614
SEE THE PROBLEM IN

00:05:07.113 --> 00:05:11.484
ORANGE COUNTY, WE SEE THE

00:05:07.747 --> 00:05:13.486
PROBLEM IN L.A.

00:05:11.618 --> 00:05:13.954
WE ARE BRINGING MORE PEOPLE INTO

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:16.489
THE SITUATION.

00:05:14.087 --> 00:05:18.358
MORE PEOPLE WHO ARE INDIGENT AND

00:05:16.623 --> 00:05:19.292
THEMSELVES ARE WITHOUT JOBS AT A

00:05:18.491 --> 00:05:22.395
WAY TO SUPPORT THEMSELVES.

00:05:19.426 --> 00:05:23.630
I DON'T SEE HOW THE SANCTUARY

00:05:22.529 --> 00:05:26.500
STATUS OF SAN FRANCISCO OR THE

00:05:23.764 --> 00:05:27.267
STATE IS DOING ANYBODY ANY

00:05:26.633 --> 00:05:28.101
FAVORS.

00:05:27.400 --> 00:05:29.770
ETHAN AND KAREN, GREAT SEGMENT,

00:05:28.235 --> 00:05:30.537
THANK YOU SO MUCH.

